HOW THE APP WORKS

============================================================

Step | Action
-----|----------------------------------------------------
1    | User clicks "Get Random Puppy"
2    | getRandomDog() is called
3    | setLoading(true) starts loading
4    | Button displays "Loading..."
5    | fetch() sends request to Dog CEO API
6    | API returns random dog image URL
7    | response.json() converts response to JavaScript object
8    | setImageUrl(data.message) updates image state
9    | Component re-renders with the new image
10   | setLoading(false) stops loading
11   | Button returns to "Get Random Puppy"
12   | User sees the dog image

Simple Flow
Button Click
     ↓
getRandomDog()
     ↓
setLoading(true)
     ↓
fetch(API)
     ↓
API Response
     ↓
response.json()
     ↓
data.message
     ↓
setImageUrl()
     ↓
State Updated
     ↓
React Re-renders
     ↓
Dog Image Displayed
     ↓
setLoading(false)


